\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8.1}{\ignorespaces Results on SWE-Bench Verified. We report the better result from $k\in \{5,10\}$ for every configuration. \emph {Non-Loop \%} is the fraction of trajectories that do \emph {not} repeat a Bash command in three consecutive steps. ``+ SFT'' is a critic trained on teacher critiques generated with the high-level prompt (a \texttt {CWM-32B}{} + \texttt {Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B}{} mix). ``+ SFT + DPO'' further optimizes the 4B SFT critic with DPO on critique preference pairs. All arrows compare to ``No Critic" setting. \textbf {Bold} highlights the best non-Opus value in each column.\relax }}{106}{table.caption.72}%
